    "ioi_q25_ms": "25th percentile of pitched attack intervals in milliseconds.",
    "ioi_q75_ms": "75th percentile of pitched attack intervals in milliseconds.",
    "ioi_lag1_correlation": "Lag-one correlation of consecutive attack intervals; negative values describe alternation, not a guaranteed swing ratio."
